Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: %empty
    2        | program function

    3 function_header: FUNC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER

    4 function: function_header LEFTPAREN new_parameters RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

    5 new_parameters: %empty
    6               | new_parameter

    7 new_parameter: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
    8              | type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER COMMA new_parameter

    9 parameters: %empty
   10           | parameter

   11 parameter: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
   12          | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER COMMA parameter

   13 statements: %empty
   14           | statements statement

   15 statement: new_variable
   16          | function_call
   17          | print
   18          | if_statement
   19          | while_statement
   20          | read_statement
   21          | return_statement
   22          | assign_statement
   23          | BREAK SEMICOLON
   24          | CONTINUE SEMICOLON

   25 assign_statement: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN NUMBER SEMICOLON
   26                 | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expressions SEMICOLON

   27 return_statement: RETURN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON

   28 if_statement: IF LEFTPAREN boolean_expressions RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY else_statement
   29             | IF boolean_expressions LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY else_statement

   30 else_statement: ELSE LEFTCURLY statement RIGHTCURLY
   31               | %empty

   32 while_statement: WHILE boolean_expressions LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY
   33                | WHILE LEFTPAREN boolean_expressions RIGHTPAREN LEFTCURLY statements RIGHTCURLY

   34 read_statement: READ LEFTPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   35 boolean_expressions: expression GREATER expression
   36                    | expression LESS expression
   37                    | expression LESSEQUAL expression
   38                    | expression GREATEREQUAL expression
   39                    | expression EQUALITY expression
   40                    | expression NOTEQUAL expression

   41 new_variable: type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   42             | type TOKEN_IDENTIFIER ASSIGN NUMBER SEMICOLON

   43 type: INT

   44 print: PRINT LEFTPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER RIGHTPAREN SEMICOLON

   45 function_call: TOKEN_IDENTIFIER LEFTPAREN parameters SEMICOLON

   46 expressions: %empty
   47            | expressions expression

   48 expression: NUMBER
   49           | TOKEN_IDENTIFIER
   50           | expression PLUS expression
   51           | expression SUBTRACT expression
   52           | expression MULTIPLY expression
   53           | expression DIVIDE expression
   54           | expression MODULUS expression


